abstract: >-
  A neurosymbolic foundation for complex decision-making,
  natural language processing, structural knowledge
  representation, and logical & deterministic reasoning that
  enables developers to build trustworthy cognitive agents -
  agents that are reliable (repeatable, provably correct
  reasoning), steerable (programmatic enforcement of
  behavior directives), and explainable (causal provenance
  of all decisions).
